window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>From USA Today bestselling author Rebecca Hefner</b><br> <b><i>She’s determined to save the world…even if she doesn’t remember it.</i></b></p> <p><b>Book 1: Repressed Echoes</b><br> A brilliant scientist wakes up with amnesia in a dystopian world, only to realize she’s the one who destroyed it! Can she repair the damage while fighting her attraction to the man who claims to be her husband?</p> <p><b>Book 2: Scorched Redemption</b><br> Two soldiers thrust together in a perilous mission can’t deny their sizzling chemistry. Arianna is determined to resist, but stoic Dominic will stop at nothing to possess her, body and soul.</p> <p><b>Book 3: Fated Salvation</b><br> Morally-gray mercenary Tristan never stopped loving his ex-wife, even when she married his greatest enemy. Now that he knows the truth, can they work together to restore peace?</p> <p><b><i>Join the team of survivors as they endeavor to save the world! Perfect for lovers of sci-fi and paranormal romance, dystopian and post-apocalyptic, and steamy romantic suspense!</i></b></p>"; 
